\newlabel{tab:corpus-rejection-causes}{{8.8}{60}{S2ELab patterns rejected, broken down by cause. \emph {Substring Search} includes all patterns without the fully anchored \texttt {\textasciicircum \ldots \textdollar } shape: unanchored, one-sided anchored, and nested-anchors}{table.caption.65}{}}
